### Auth Service - User Management Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8003

### 1. Create User
POST http://localhost:8003/users/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123",
  "full_name": "John Doe"
}

### 2. Get User by ID
GET http://localhost:8003/users/id
Authorization: Bearer

### 3. Get All Users
GET http://localhost:8003/users/?skip=0&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer

### 4. Get User by Email
GET http://localhost:8003/users/?email=example@mail.com
Authorization: Bearer

### 5. Update User
PATCH http://localhost:8003/users/id
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer

{
  "full_name": "John Smith"
}

### 6. Update User Password
PATCH http://localhost:8003/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer

{
  "password": "newsecurepassword456"
}

### 7. Update User Email and Name
PATCH http://localhost:8003/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer

{
  "email": "john.smith@example.com",
  "full_name": "John Smith Jr."
}

### 8. Delete User
DELETE http://localhost:8003/users/1
Authorization: Bearer

### Create Additional Users for Testing
POST http://localhost:8003/users/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "full_name": "Jane Doe"
}

